{"chapter_id":"main-quest-71816","main_id":71816,"main_title":"灯下未归人","main_description":"大多数璃月人都在享受海灯节，镖师黄衫却正在发愁…","chapter_title":"灯下未归人","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":2,"subquest_id":7181603,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":7181603,"sequence":0,"variant":0,"line_id":718160301,"next_line_ids":[],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":206301,"speaker_text_hash":2170598109,"speaker":"弗朗西斯","speaker_raw":"弗朗西斯","text_hash":1627841218,"text":"货怎么还没来，我的肚子已经饿得咕咕叫了。","raw_text":"货怎么还没来，我的肚子已经饿得咕咕叫了。","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/7181603.json"}
