{"chapter_id":"main-quest-71816","main_id":71816,"main_title":"灯下未归人","main_description":"大多数璃月人都在享受海灯节，镖师黄衫却正在发愁…","chapter_title":"灯下未归人","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":4,"subquest_id":7181605,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":7181605,"sequence":3,"variant":0,"line_id":718160504,"next_line_ids":[718160505],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":220701,"speaker_text_hash":2800811709,"speaker":"黄衫","speaker_raw":"黄衫","text_hash":3321551858,"text":"这趟多亏你帮忙，干活拿报酬是天经地义，我也不会短你的。你稍等一下啊…","raw_text":"这趟多亏你帮忙，干活拿报酬是天经地义，我也不会短你的。你稍等一下啊…","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/7181605.json"}
{"chapter_id":"main-quest-71816","main_id":71816,"main_title":"灯下未归人","main_description":"大多数璃月人都在享受海灯节，镖师黄衫却正在发愁…","chapter_title":"灯下未归人","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":4,"subquest_id":7181605,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":7181605,"sequence":4,"variant":0,"line_id":718160505,"next_line_ids":[718160506],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speaker_id":0,"speaker_text_hash":0,"speaker":"旅行者","speaker_raw":"旅行者","text_hash":2452918138,"text":"海灯节也不休息吗？","raw_text":"海灯节也不休息吗？","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/7181605.json"}
