{"chapter_id":"main-quest-71816","main_id":71816,"main_title":"灯下未归人","main_description":"大多数璃月人都在享受海灯节，镖师黄衫却正在发愁…","chapter_title":"灯下未归人","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":4,"subquest_id":7181605,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":7181605,"sequence":6,"variant":0,"line_id":718160507,"next_line_ids":[718160508,718160510],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":220701,"speaker_text_hash":2800811709,"speaker":"黄衫","speaker_raw":"黄衫","text_hash":930111330,"text":"你是在四处旅行吧，大家在海灯节的时候都会放霄灯，你也可以体验体验。","raw_text":"你是在四处旅行吧，大家在海灯节的时候都会放霄灯，你也可以体验体验。","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/7181605.json"}
{"chapter_id":"main-quest-71816","main_id":71816,"main_title":"灯下未归人","main_description":"大多数璃月人都在享受海灯节，镖师黄衫却正在发愁…","chapter_title":"灯下未归人","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":4,"subquest_id":7181605,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":7181605,"sequence":7,"variant":0,"line_id":718160508,"next_line_ids":[718160509],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speaker_id":0,"speaker_text_hash":0,"speaker":"旅行者","speaker_raw":"旅行者","text_hash":3721766858,"text":"那你呢？","raw_text":"那你呢？","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/7181605.json"}
