{"chapter_id":"main-quest-71816","main_id":71816,"main_title":"灯下未归人","main_description":"大多数璃月人都在享受海灯节，镖师黄衫却正在发愁…","chapter_title":"灯下未归人","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":4,"subquest_id":7181605,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":7181605,"sequence":9,"variant":0,"line_id":718160512,"next_line_ids":[718160513],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":220701,"speaker_text_hash":2800811709,"speaker":"黄衫","speaker_raw":"黄衫","text_hash":1741993490,"text":"要是有现成的，放一盏博个好彩头也不错，可惜我是没空自己编霄灯了…","raw_text":"要是有现成的，放一盏博个好彩头也不错，可惜我是没空自己编霄灯了…","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/7181605.json"}
