{"chapter_id":"main-quest-71816","main_id":71816,"main_title":"灯下未归人","main_description":"大多数璃月人都在享受海灯节，镖师黄衫却正在发愁…","chapter_title":"灯下未归人","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":4,"subquest_id":7181605,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":7181605,"sequence":14,"variant":0,"line_id":718160510,"next_line_ids":[718160511],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speaker_id":0,"speaker_text_hash":0,"speaker":"旅行者","speaker_raw":"旅行者","text_hash":666565378,"text":"你放霄灯了吗？","raw_text":"你放霄灯了吗？","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/7181605.json"}
{"chapter_id":"main-quest-71816","main_id":71816,"main_title":"灯下未归人","main_description":"大多数璃月人都在享受海灯节，镖师黄衫却正在发愁…","chapter_title":"灯下未归人","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":4,"subquest_id":7181605,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":7181605,"sequence":15,"variant":0,"line_id":718160511,"next_line_ids":[718160512],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":220701,"speaker_text_hash":2800811709,"speaker":"黄衫","speaker_raw":"黄衫","text_hash":1759705858,"text":"这倒还没有，我们在外漂泊的人，哪有这些闲功夫。","raw_text":"这倒还没有，我们在外漂泊的人，哪有这些闲功夫。","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/7181605.json"}
{"chapter_id":"main-quest-71816","main_id":71816,"main_title":"灯下未归人","main_description":"大多数璃月人都在享受海灯节，镖师黄衫却正在发愁…","chapter_title":"灯下未归人","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":5,"subquest_id":7181607,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":7181607,"sequence":0,"variant":0,"line_id":718160701,"next_line_ids":[718160702],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":220701,"speaker_text_hash":2800811709,"speaker":"黄衫","speaker_raw":"黄衫","text_hash":1171188338,"text":"哦？这霄灯真不错，多谢你了。我想想，霄灯里的愿望该怎么写…","raw_text":"哦？这霄灯真不错，多谢你了。我想想，霄灯里的愿望该怎么写…","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/7181607.json"}
{"chapter_id":"main-quest-71816","main_id":71816,"main_title":"灯下未归人","main_description":"大多数璃月人都在享受海灯节，镖师黄衫却正在发愁…","chapter_title":"灯下未归人","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":5,"subquest_id":7181607,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":7181607,"sequence":1,"variant":0,"line_id":718160702,"next_line_ids":[718160703],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":220701,"speaker_text_hash":2800811709,"speaker":"黄衫","speaker_raw":"黄衫","text_hash":3269685978,"text":"我这人也琢磨不出多好听的愿望…那就写个「万事如意」吧。","raw_text":"我这人也琢磨不出多好听的愿望…那就写个「万事如意」吧。","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/7181607.json"}
{"chapter_id":"main-quest-71816","main_id":71816,"main_title":"灯下未归人","main_description":"大多数璃月人都在享受海灯节，镖师黄衫却正在发愁…","chapter_title":"灯下未归人","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":5,"subquest_id":7181607,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":7181607,"sequence":2,"variant":0,"line_id":718160703,"next_line_ids":[718160704],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":220701,"speaker_text_hash":2800811709,"speaker":"黄衫","speaker_raw":"黄衫","text_hash":3010120386,"text":"只要所有事都能像预料的那样走，我就谢谢岩王爷了。","raw_text":"只要所有事都能像预料的那样走，我就谢谢岩王爷了。","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/7181607.json"}
